---
import StudioLayout from '../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import TropicTumbleSpotlight from '../components/TropicTumbleSpotlight.astro';
---
<StudioLayout title="Tropic Tumble — A Strategic Sloth original" description="Play Tropic Tumble, our released sticker merge game on Android. Merge, collect, and fill tropical scenes. Published by Strategic Sloth LLC.">
<section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">GAMES / RELEASED ON GOOGLE PLAY</p><h1>Tropic Tumble.<br>Small stickers. Big delight.</h1><p class="lede">Our latest game release brings a tropical world to your pocket. A complete mobile game, with a browser demo you can try here.</p></section>
<TropicTumbleSpotlight detail />
<section class="section container compact"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MERGE / COLLECT / CREATE</p><h2>From the first merge<br>to your finished island.</h2></div><p>76 stickers, nine scenes, timed events, and an Island Pass. The screenshots below come from the game.</p></div><div class="tropic-gallery">{[['shot-1-merge','Merge stickers through jelly, painted, and shiny stages.'],['shot-2-scene','Place your collected stickers in tropical scenes.'],['shot-3-home','Choose a scene and jump into your next round.']].map(([file,caption])=><figure><img src={`/media/tropic-tumble/${file}.webp`} alt={caption} width="540" height="960" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>{caption}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
<section class="section container" id="play"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TRY THE BROWSER DEMO</p><h2>A little island break.</h2></div><p>The browser demo runs purchases and ads in clearly labeled test mode. The released Android version is available on Google Play.</p></div><div class="tropic-demo" data-tropic-demo><button class="button" type="button" data-tropic-start>Load playable demo ▶</button><p>The game loads from Remi’s portfolio when you choose to play. Sound starts after interaction.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://remiclassic.github.io/remiresume/tropictumble/game/index.html?debug=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the browser demo full screen ↗</a></section>
<section class="contact-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SHIPPED GAME / A CONNECTED PRACTICE</p><h2>Have a mini-game<br>in mind for your product?</h2><p>Game design, interface, motion, and implementation in one studio.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/services/">Explore studio services ↗</a></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
<script>
document.querySelector('[data-tropic-start]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{
 const host=document.querySelector('[data-tropic-demo]');if(!host)return;
 const frame=document.createElement('iframe');frame.src='https://remiclassic.github.io/remiresume/tropictumble/game/index.html?debug=1';frame.title='Tropic Tumble playable browser demo, purchases and ads in test mode';frame.allow='vibrate';host.replaceChildren(frame);
});
</script>
<style>.tropic-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:30px}.tropic-gallery figure{margin:0;background:#e9edde;padding:20px;border-radius:12px}.tropic-gallery img{width:100%;max-width:280px;margin:auto;border-radius:14px}.tropic-gallery figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px}.tropic-demo{min-height:250px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;background:#e1efe7;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px}.tropic-demo p{font-size:13px;text-align:center}.tropic-demo :global(iframe){display:block;flex:none;width:min(100%,412px);height:780px;max-height:85vh;border:0;border-radius:14px;background:#3aa7ee}@media(max-width:650px){.tropic-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tropic-gallery img{max-width:260px}.tropic-demo{padding:12px}}</style>
